  "notes": "Agent re-read after the Code Health refactor, 2026-11-07, under the owner directive transcribed in verification/reviews/rulings/agent-rereview-after-refactor-2026-11-07.md. This record is NOT an owner signature: it attests the agent's substantive reading only. Read the nine units: the three taxonomies (core, policy, http-profile carrier projection, client binding-spec refusal) have no diff. The guard test audit_vocabulary_guard_test split into corpus.rs, producers.rs, source.rs and vocabulary.rs. no_producer_outside_core_mints_a_wire_token now calls producers::assert_no_carrier_mints_a_token and assert_projections_decide_the_verdicts over the same six carrier files, the same projection signatures and the same wildcard refusal; Source::mcp_re_literals returns the same set as the old scanner. mcp-re-test-paths gained is_test_file: a file whose first code line is #![cfg(test)] is test code, which is true of how rustc compiles it, so such a file correctly leaves the production half; production_lines is otherwise unchanged. 59 of 64 cited tests have identical bodies; the four brace-scan tests differ only by sharing assert_region_elided (the identifier-ending-in-r test now also asserts the region's body is elided, which is stronger than before), and the fifth is the test above. The claim holds. Every cited Rust test still exists by name; I compared each one's body with its body at the last record's commit and name the ones that differ. Helper functions that unchanged test bodies call were not all diffed. The mutation lane was not run. Evidence class as registered. || Re-read after the SDK binding refactor (#1370), 2026-11-08. The only input that moved since the last record is verification/generated/rust-targets.json, whose file lists gained the new sdk/python/src and sdk/typescript/src modules (entry_points, results, sign_inputs, verify_inputs); no vocabulary taxonomy, guard test or mcp-re-test-paths source changed (git diff since the last record is empty for them). The guard still scans sdk/python and sdk/typescript as producer trees: audit_vocabulary_guard_test passes over the new files. The claim holds. This record is NOT an owner signature: it attests the agent's reading only. Evidence class as registered.",
